<title>USA: 3M unveils Post-it Notes for printers.</title>
<headline>3M unveils Post-it Notes for printers.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co on Monday unveiled a new line of Post-it Notes for use with computer printers.</p>
<p>3M said its Post-it Signs and Post-it-Notes for ink jet and laser printer are available immediately.</p>
<p>The printable Post-it Notes come six-to-a-page and are designed to run through a printer multiple times. The Post-it Signs measure 8-1/2 inches by 11, and have special adhesive strips.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
